  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"3d-mace\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PSljfJZ.png\"></p>\n\n<h1>Undopia 3D 戰鎚</h1>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fundopia-3d-mace\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/undopia-3d-mace?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=1bd96a\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/undopia-3d-mace\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1058329?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fundugt\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"ko-fi\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wv1uE4k.png\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>3D Mace 為手持狀態下的戰鎚添加了 3D 模型（GUI 中除外），如同三叉戟一般。\n注意：在 1.21.4 之前的版本中無法實現此功能，且在這些版本中 GUI 內的戰鎚也會呈現 3D 效果。</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Undopia Patch 資源包\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/beZ50qS.png\"></a></p>\n\n<p>本資源包屬於 Undopia Patch 系列。</p>\n\n<p>它由以下 Undopia Patch 功能組成：</p>\n\n<p>\n    <img alt=\"qzSddSv.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qzSddSv.png\">\n<img alt=\"KTdrpVw.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KTdrpVw.png\">\n\n</p>\n\n<p>若您希望自訂上述任何項目，請使用 Undopia Patch 自訂工具。</p>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<hr>\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fundopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\n<img alt=\"Wb9cSra.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Wb9cSra.png\">\n\n<p>從 <strong>KCB Hosting</strong> 獲取屬於您的專屬遊戲伺服器！</p>\n\n</a>\n\n<hr>\n\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252fcustom-downloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"自訂工具\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UEAZSvr.png\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"常見問題\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GGUjVLj.png\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252fterms-and-conditions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"條款與條件\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kVzzs3F.png\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/UnduGT/undopiapatch/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"錯誤回報 / 功能建議\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mYSKqtv.png\"></a>\n</p>\n\n</div>",
